<b><div align="center">APPENDIX A</div></b>

<br>
<b>Persons Participating in the Investigation</b>

<b><u>Kingwood Mining Company LLC</u></b>

<blockquote>Frank Matras .......... President/General Manager<br>
Perry Ryan .......... Superintendent<br>
Joe Swerbinsky .......... Chief Engineer<br>
